g  on youtube because you don't just want  to be me  right you don't want to copy me you want  to have your own style if you fire up a  youtube channel and you're basically a  mini version of me you're never going to  get as big as me classes like this  will teach you how to develop your own  identity they'll teach you how to  develop your own youtube channel in such  a way to where it can become an  extension of yourself  everything ranging from developing huge  ideas to populating your world with  different concepts and philosophies  creating your own kind of style key  this will teach you that and that's the  benefit of skillshare it offers  membership with meaning where you can  connect with the support of fellow  creatives and enter a community of  encouragement communication and  inspiration  so the first 1 000 of my subscribers to  click the link in the description  will get a one month free trial of  skillshare so you can start exploring  your creativity today having said that  let's get back into our video  so the funny thing about an ils is he  came about after a ship carrying life  spores through the negative zone to see  life on various planets was hit by a  meteor sending its spores to a planet  known as  atheros now over the years one of those  spores would mutate and evolve into  annihilus who later found the crashed  ship  and absorbed all the information stored  in it making him incredibly intelligent  now  after gaining all this knowledge instead  of using it to try and better the world  around him  annihilus did exactly what i would  probably do because i love the idea of  being a villain he became obsessed with  killing anything  and everything that he perceives as  being any kind of a threat i'm a  terrible person but i'm sorry guys  if i gained superpowers i would become a  bad guy right like that's basically  exactly what i would do but annihilus  becomes the ruler of the negative zone  as well as becoming a frequent  antagonist of the fantastic four now as  far as his powers go annihilus has  enhanced physical attributes stemming  from his armored exoskeleton annihilus  has demonstrated incredible strength on  several occasions  often going toe-to-toe with some of  marvel's heaviest hitters and inflicting  some major damage in the process  he was able to straight thrash the  original captain marvel  punched through the force fields created  by quasar's gauntlets and  matched strength with thunderstrike who  was kind of like a knockoff version of  thor in the 1990s that nobody liked but  who was still pretty much equivalent to  thor in terms of power level now  annihilus was not only able to knock out  the thing but was also able to break off  a piece of his rocky hide which is  incredibly durable and has withstood  many punches from the hulk without  breaking so annihilus is definitely up  there among the strongest marvel  characters now his exoskeleton which is  made of an alloy of matter and  antimatter also affords nihilus a great  deal of durability as he's withstood  some of the heaviest hitters in marvel  comics for instance when the thing  punched the nihilus it actually injures  his hand and annihilus absolutely tanks  the human torch's nova flame which is  the hottest flame he can create it's the  temperature of the sun  annihilus was also able to withstand  strikes from thor  while he was wielding mjolnir a punch  from the incredible hulk which was  actually rick jones at the time not  bruce banner but he was still really  strong  and is unfazed by an attack from  blastart a character  that's destroyed planets so in addition  to possessing immense strength annihilus  is also  incredibly durable pretty much to the  point of being invulnerable  and annihilus durability is not limited  to purely physical attacks either  but he also seems to be immune to the  scarlet witch's hexes as well  so harming annihilus is not an easy task  by any means  now in addition to his strength and  durability a nihilist exoskeleton  allows him to survive the vacuum of  space but his exoskeleton  is only the beginning of his power set  as he is made  vastly more powerful by his mastery over  the cosmic control rod one of the most  powerful artifacts in the history of  marvel comics the cosmic control rock  those of you guys who don't know was  created by annihilus after he found the  starship that crashed in the negative  zone and put on a helmet that  transferred all the knowledge it  contained  into annihilus mind and since creating  it annihilus has used the cosmic control  rod for a variety of purposes  but mostly to prolong the lifespan of  his cells which has allowed him to live  far longer than he otherwise would since  insects typically have short lives but  the cosmic control rod allows the  nihilus to manipulate matter and energy  on the atomic level which he takes  advantage of to augment his physical  attributes to even greater proportions  and produce powerful blasts of cosmic  energy one of which was able to match  the energy blast from thanos  not only can annihilus use the cosmic  control rod to project energy but he can  also drain  energy from others as well and he's used  this to drain energy from characters as  powerful as odin and quasar and in the  latter instance once he drained quasar's  energy he also stole his quantum bands  making him  even more powerful the cosmic control  rod also grants the nihilists other  powers such as telekinesis and telepathy  and although annihilus is an extremely  powerful character in his own right  he's made even more formidable by his  control over the annihilation wave which  is  basically a massive army of insect-like  bugs and an armada of spacecraft that  have threatened the very existence of  the marvel universe in response to the  positive matter universe encroaching on  the negative zone annihilus  brings his annihilation wave into the  universe to conquer it and when i say  that the annihilation wave was the  threat to the universe's existence i'm  not exaggerating at all  one of the ships in annihilation's  armada is called the harvester of soros  which was able to destroy  entire planets and use their energy to  supply the rest of the wave with food  and fuel so planetary destruction is  definitely within annihilus abilities  through his annihilation wave  the wave was also able to take out the  entirety of the nova corps  break through the barriers separating  the positive and negative zones and most  impressively  kill galactus and all the celestials  unfortunately we are not explicitly told  or  shown how this happens but during jim  starlin's graphic novel  thanos the infinity finale were shown  the aftermath of it and the fact that  the annihilation wave was able to take  out galactus and the celestials is  incredibly impressive as those are some  of the most powerful entities in the  marvel universe and are  all far beyond omega level themselves  it's worth pointing out though that  during the annihilation event that  basically set the tone for the modern  cosmic landscape and comics galactus was  able to destroy the annihilation wave so  there is a fair bit of inconsistency  with regard to the relative power levels  of the annihilation wave and galactus  but that's to be expected when different  writers have different takes on  characters and concepts the other part  of that is  a lot of people look at jim starlin's  infinity series basically everything  after infinity war as being out of  continuity so  take that as you will but also during  annihilation annihilus attack  is repelled through a joint effort of a  ton of marvel cosmic heroes and  annihilus himself  is actually killed by nova but he would  not stay dead long  and was actually reborn as an infant  with all of his memories and this  actually sets up another one of  annihilus powers which is that each time  he dies he's reborn  making him effectively immortal as we  learn in fantastic four number  600 so it seems as if the marvel  universe will never be free of the  threat of annihilus and his annihilation  wave due to his seemingly compulsive  ability  for endless resurrection as well as his  ability to raise an army in a very short  period of time  which he's been able to do each time  they've been destroyed and yeah that's  pretty much all you need to know about  annihilus like i said  i can't imagine him not showing up in  the mcu sometime in the future because  he's just such a massive threat way more  of a threat than thanos ever was but let  me know what you guys think down in the  comments section do you guys think  you'll see annihilus in the mcu  let me know below thank you guys for  watching and i will catch you all later  peace you
 

